{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361160/extras/sinopsis_intestazione.png?t=1743689842\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a college student, you live a quiet life with your parents and friends in a small seaside resort town. However, the death of your great-grandmother will unleash a series of events that will lead you to investigate her past, and to delve into her supposed relationship with the most powerful and feared family in town: <strong><i>The House of Valier.</i></strong>  <br> <br><strong>Vampires? Wizards? Followers of a Sect?</strong> There are many legends about <strong><i>the Valiers</i></strong>, but the one thing everyone seems to agree on is that they are extremely dangerous people.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361160/extras/gruppo_intestazione.png?t=1743689842\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>An Otome game, full of romance, suspense and mystery!\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Become the protagonist, create your own adventure and make choices that define your behavior, influence the way characters interact with you and lead to alternative endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <strong>Choose between two completely different romantic paths.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face the darkest secrets of Venice with your best friend as your partner or be seduced by the young and enigmatic <strong><i>Valier</i></strong> who will change the way you see life forever. <br> <br>The choice is yours: <strong><i>will you embrace the darkness or face it?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i><u>GAME FEATURES</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Movie soundtrack and sound effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 100% immersive first-person experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 Detailed and realistic character design.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 More than 50 full color CGI.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 11 chapters per route (2 routes).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 6 different endings (3 per route).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2014 More than 145.000 words</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361160/extras/disclosure.png?t=1743689842\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3361160?t=1743689842","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361160/16cbd57685152ee304748b11315650b5f48eeada/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743689842","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361160/35535ee7563fbbd6163c65ce4c31cd3229b833d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743689842","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361160/35535ee7563fbbd6163c65ce4c31cd3229b833d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743689842","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,5],"notes":"Sexual scenes contained in this game are part of the romance between the protagonist and her partner, and are described and depicted in a romantic and delicate way. Scenes of violence are rare and are not graphically depicted, only described in the narrative."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361160/extras/sinopsis_intestazione.png?t=1743689842\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As a college student, you live a quiet life with your parents and friends in a small seaside resort to